== CANON-17/19: GetLn checks that the line is well-formed UTF-8 (RFC 3629);
== invalid input stops the program with a runtime fault (kind 13).
Main :
    Line String := ""
    GetLn(Line)
    PutLn("[", Line, "]")
    GetLn(Line)
    PutLn("unreachable ", Line)
;
